---
import { compare, example, money } from '../lib/engine';
import type { Inputs } from '../lib/engine';
interface Props { scenario?:'baseline'|'low'|'joint'|'public'|'new'; }
const {scenario='baseline'} = Astro.props;
const setup:Record<string,Partial<Inputs>>={
  baseline:{},low:{income:20000,dependents:1},joint:{filing:'joint',spouseIncome:30000,spouseBalance:30000,dependents:1},
  public:{pslf:true,certified:36},new:{vintage:'new-direct',initialDebt:30000},
};
const inputs={...example,...setup[scenario]};
const rows=compare(inputs);
---
<figure class="tool-pane card"><figcaption><strong>Worked calculator example</strong></figcaption>
<p>Assumes {money(inputs.loans[0].balance)} of Direct Unsubsidized debt at {new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US',{maximumFractionDigits:2}).format(inputs.loans[0].rate*100)}% and {money(inputs.income)} borrower AGI. {inputs.filing==='joint' && `Joint scenario includes ${money(inputs.spouseIncome)} spouse AGI and ${money(inputs.spouseBalance)} eligible spouse debt.`} {inputs.pslf && `Assumes qualifying employment and ${inputs.certified} previously certified PSLF payments.`} {inputs.dependents>0 && `Uses ${inputs.dependents} claimed dependent.`}</p>
<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Plan</th><th scope="col">Starts at</th><th scope="col">Projected payments</th><th scope="col">Projected forgiveness</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>{rows.map(row=><tr><th scope="row">{row.title}</th><td>{money(row.starting)}</td><td>{money(row.paid)}</td><td>{money(row.forgiven)}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div><p>Monthly projections exclude taxes, approximate daily interest as monthly APR/12 and do not establish eligibility. Compare with Federal Student Aid and your loan servicer before acting.</p></figure>
